  "_doc": "Stream E (M2). Site templates for the PLAN §3.4 floor: forts (every zone has >= 1), farms (>= 2), caves (1-2 single-floor dungeons). Props are relative metres, `kind` as in vignettes (prop/ground = highdef-3d kit ids, tree = species). Fort `garrison`: friendly forts hold NPC roles; hostile ones hold monster camps (`blight`/`undead` = alternative mixes the bake picks by archetype). Caves are dungeon-tiers plans with floors: 1 and a small boss (an elite of a bestiary id). `byArchetype` = relative weights the bake uses. Bodies for buildings come from F's proctown fort/farm kits; these templates say what goes in and around them.",
